he fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-driven goal:</strong> Your mission isn't just to survive, but to repair the main <strong>receiver</strong> and finally hear the President’s message that could decide the fate of all survivors.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976500/extras/d671c7b1f62e271c7aa2e8cd9ae61e1a.webp?t=1786011334\" width=780 height=10 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Miner by day. Defender by night.</i></strong><br><strong><i>Will you live to see the sunrise?</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976500/extras/572d479d373f71157b42dad24bd1754d.avif?t=1786011334\" width=500 height=70 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dig by day, fight by night in this blend of mining and Tower Defense. As the last Spotter at a ruined gas station, hold back mutant hordes, scavenge the wasteland, and repair your receiver to capture the President’s vital message and humanity’s last hope.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian, Serbian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976500/851e66a5aa095eb63068128de719250296cc5be4/header.jpg?t=1786011334", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976500/3302588259517f91b3186229010080e3b05b36d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786011334", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976500/3